# Requests for the REST Client extension (VS Code). Every endpoint needs an Azure AD B2C bearer token:
# put it in a .env file next to this one (git-ignored) as EVENTVIEWER_TOKEN=<token>
@host = http://localhost:5189
@token = {{$dotenv EVENTVIEWER_TOKEN}}
@correlationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Flow of a CorrelationId
GET {{host}}/api/eventflow/flow/{{correlationId}}?includeInsightsLogs=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search flows
POST {{host}}/api/eventflow/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-10-14T06:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-10-14T08:00:00Z",
  "status": "Failed",
  "includeInsightsLogs": false,
  "saveResults": false
}

### List saved flows
GET {{host}}/api/eventflow/saved
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Load a saved flow (use a name returned by the previous request)
GET {{host}}/api/eventflow/load/EventFlow_00000000_20261014_080000.json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
